<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="JAS" style="id">James</book>
  <para style="h">James</para>
  <para style="toc1">James</para>
  <para style="toc2">James</para>
  <para style="mt">James</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pathian le Topa Jesus Christ ii naseampa James in: leitung bup ah a kithethaang Pathian mite kong paupui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka suapuite awng, ze etna namcin na thuak uh ciangin hampha in na kingaisun tavun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />banghang ziam cile, na upna in tuabang ze etnate na zaw zawkciang, thuak zawkna piang hi ci in na he uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Note sia a kicing, a cialcing, bangma a kitaangsamh ngawlte na hi natu in na thuak zawknate in note, puk ngawlin lam tawntung hong khosak tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ahihang note khat po in, ciimna na nei buale, a pia tu pa Pathian tungah thu ngen tahen; banghang ziam cile Pathian in ngo tatak le thuthiam takin, a kuama theampo tungah pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ahihang thu na nget uh ciangin, na up tu kul a, up laakna na nei ngawl het tu uh kisamh hi. Up laakna a nei khat pawpo sia, tuipi tungah vui ii seam kawkoai tuihual taw kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuabang mihing khat, a sepna theampo ah a thin a khensat thei ngawl khat sia in, Topa tung pan bangma nga tu in ngaisun heak hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A zawng Tapidawte a zawnna pan Pathian in a lapto ciangin a lungdam tu uh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />tuaciangin a hau Tapidawte sia Pathian in a khiasuk le a lungdam tu uh ahi hi. Banghang ziam cile a hau khat sia ngam lopa paak bangin bo tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ni hong suak a, nisa in a kung hal a; a paak pulin a hoina teng siacipsak hi. Tuasia bangma in mihaupa sia a nasepna ah, a sep laitakin kisusia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ze etna haksa a thuak zote in a lungdam mihing ahi hi, banghang ziam cile tuabang hong sit nate a zaw ciangin, Pathian a itte tungah a kamciamsa nuntakna sia tel in saang tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mihing khat sia tuabang haksatnate taw ze etna a thuak le, “Hi ze etna sia, Pathian kung panin hong pai hi,” ci heak hen. Banghang ziam cile Pathian sia siatna in ze et zo ngawl hi, tuaciang ama mama in kuama a ze et bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ahihang mihingte sia, amate ii a pha ngawl deinate in kai a, a awk ciang, ze etna thuak ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuasia ciangin amate ii deina pha ngawlte a sung uh ah paai in mawna piangsak hi; tuaciang, mawna hong khanthin tak ciangin thina piangsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ka it suapuite awng, theamna um heak vun!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A pha tel le ziakte le a cingtaak letsong theampo vantung panin hong pai hi; tua teng sia vantung khuavakte a bitphua, kikheal ngeingawl a, kihei in khua a zingsak ngawl Pathian kung pan hong paisuk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ama ii piansaknate theampo sung pan a thupibel ih sua thei natu in, thumaan kammal tungtawnin, ama ii deina om babangin eite hong piangsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ka it suapuite awng, hi thu ciamtee tavun! Mihing khat simin thu ngaina thu zaakna ah manlang tu a, ahizong pau papaih ngawl tu a thin uuk papaih ngawl tu kul hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mihingte thin uukna in, Pathian ii thutang tupna taangtung ngawlsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua ahikom a kiihuai zongsang nate le seksolnate theampo vawk siat vun. Pathian tungah ki aap vun a, na thinsung ah hong khum a kammal na saang vun, tua in note hong ngum thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ama ii kammal ngaina bek taw noma le noma kitheam heak vun a; ngamtatna taw zui paih zaw vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A kuama po kammal ngai a, a zui ngawlte sia limlangh sung ki en a, ama le ama a pian babangin a kimu mihing khat taw kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ama le ama pha tak a ki et zawkciangin pusuak a, ama meal bangbang hi ziam cisia mangil paih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ahihang mihingte a suaktasak a kicing thukham sia pha takin a et zawkciang thupi ngaisut tawntung a, a zaak sia a mangil kik paih sia hi ngawlin, a zui — a nuntak puite peuma sia Pathian in a sepna ah thupha pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Khat po in ama sia biakna kin mihing khat hi ing ci in a kingaisun ziam? Ama in a leei a uk zo buale ama ii a biakna sia a luithawthong suak a, ama le ama kitheam ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Pa Pathian ii a thiangtho le biakna tatak hi ci in, a ngaisut sia hi teng hi: tangate le meingongte ii thuakna sung pan khoi natu le leitung siatna panin eima le eima kikep natu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka suapuite awng, a minthang Topa, ih Topa Jesus Christ thu umte na hi uh bangma in, a puasang omzia etna taw kuama doidan ngei heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Sonteena in, mihau khat sia khamh khutzungbu bun a, puan pha silhin, kikhopna munah hong pai hen a, tuaciangin mihing khat sia puansia ngapkaai silhin, kikhopna munah hong pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Puan pha taw a kizeampa zatak piak zawkna taw, “Hi sung tona phabel tungah to in,” ci a, ahihang mizawngpa munah “Nang zia lai ah ding in, tua ahibuale ka peang kung suat tungah to in,” ci le uhte
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />tuasia ciangin noma pawlsung mama ah, kidoidanna a piangsak, a sia tupna bulphu in thukhenna taw a maw na hi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hong ngai tavun, ka it suapuite awng! Pathian in hi leitung ah mizawngte sia, upna sungah a hau tu le ama a itte atu kamciam a piak kumpi ngam a lua tu in teal zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ahihang note in mizawngte sia na thusim bua uh hi! A kuate in no hong zothaw a, thukhenmangte mai hong then ahi ziam? Mihaute hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />No hong kipiasa tua minphatna a sonsiate sia amate ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Laithiangtho sungah a kimu Kumpi ngam ii thukham na zui uh le, a maan in na a seam na hi tu uh hi. Tua thukham in, “Noma le noma na ki it uh bangma in, na innpaam pa na it vun,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ahihang mihingte tungah a puasang omzia muna taw na en uh le, mawna vawt na hi uh a, tuaciang thukham in nang sia thukham paltan pa bangin hong mawsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A kuama po thupiak khat a paltan pa in, thukham a vekpi in paltan ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile “Palngul mawna vawt heak vun,” a ci pa mama in “Mihing that heak vun,” zongh ci si hi. Palngul mawna na vawt bua hial uh zong mihing na that uh le, thukham paltan na suak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Eite hong suatak thukham sia taw thu a kikhen tu mihingte bangin pau in, ngamta vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile hesuakna a nei ngawl mihing khat tungah thu a khen ciangin, Pathian in hesuakna a lak buatu hi; ahihang hesuakna in thukhenna zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka suapuite awng, khat po in upna ka nei ci napi in, a ngamtatnate taw a lak buale, bang phatuam ziam? Tua upna in, ama ngum thei tu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Sonteena in u le nau sungah, puansilh kisamhte le, anneak tu kicingin nei ngawl om hi ci tawng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Amate tungah, “Pathian in thupha hong pia tahen! Na khua lum in, na ngilva tahen!” na ci uh hang, nuntak natu a kisamh nate na pia bua uh le na pauna in bang phattuamna om ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Upna ih ci zongh ta bangma hi: ngamtatnate a om ngawl upna in ama nguak ahikom a thi ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ahizong khat po in, hi bangin ci thei tu hi, “Mihing khat in upna nei a, a dangkhat in ngamtatnate nei hi,” ci hi. Keima zo kikna in hi bang ahi hi. “Bangbangin mihing khat po in, ngamtatna om ngawl upna nei thei tu ziam? Ka upna sia ka ngamtatnate taw hong lak tu khi hi,” ka ci tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Pathian khat bek om hi, ci in na um uh ziam? Pha hi! Doaite zongh in um a — kiitakna taw liing hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mihing mawmawte awng! ngamtatna om ngawl upna in, kimanna nei ngawl hi, ci thu a kilak tu na dei uh ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ih taanghpupi ahi Abraham sia bangbangin Pathian mai ah thutang a na suak ziam? Ngamtatnate pan hi, biaknatau tungah a tapa Isaac a piak ciang tua ngamtatna tungtawnin thutang a na suak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hi thu mu thei ngawl nu ziam? A upna le a ngamtatna sia kithua khawm a; a upna sia a ngamtatnate tungtawnin khuangkhim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuaciang laithiangtho in hi bang a ci ciangin, thumaan son ahi hi, “Abraham in, Pathian um a, tuaciang a upna hang komin, Pathian in ama sia thutang in saang hi.” Tua hi a, Abraham sia Pathian ii lawm hi kici hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tua hi a, en vun, mihing khat sia ngamtatnate taw Pathian mai ah thutang suak a, a upna bek pan hi ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Numei pumpi zuak Rahab zongh tuabang ma hi. Ama in Pathian mai a thutang a sua sia a ngamtatna pan hi, Israel thudawpkute huna pia in lampi dang khat panin, a suataksak ngamtatna pan ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tua ahikom thaa om ngawl pumpi sia a thi ahi bangma in, ngamtatna om ngawl upna sia zongh a thi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka suapuite awng, note sya seam nuam tam na om heak vun. Na heak uh bangma in ngualdang sangin ko syate tungah nasia zaw in thu hong kikhen tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ih vekpi in, sep khial ih nei bul hi. Ahihang mihing khat in, pau khialna a nei ngei buale ama sia a cialcing hi a, a pumpi bup zongh, a uk thei mi ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Siphu in ih thu hong nit thei natu in, a kam sungah kamkhau ih koi a, ih uukna pawpo ah ih paisak thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua ahibuale teambaw khat ngaisun vun: tuaza in lian a, a thahat vui ii a seamna taw kihawl hikale, a heakna no mama khat taw kiheak zo hi, tuaciangin teambaw hawlpa ii paisak nopna pawpo ah pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Leei zongh tuabang ma ahi hi: tuasia in no ahihang, na liante huvau ah kisuangtaak thei hi. Meikuang no khat taw, duipui khat a kihal theina thu ngaisun vun!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuaciang leei sia meikuang taw kibang hi. Ama sia khialna omna leitung hi a, ih pumpi sungah mun la in hong om a, ih pumpi bup tungtawnin thusia kizelsak hi. Hell pan a hong pai meikuang taw in nuntak sung tawntung hong hal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mihing in a nungta dang theampo — duisung nganhingte, vacimte, awmtaalin a vakte le, ngasate zualsak thei zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ahihang kuama in leei sia a zualsak zo ngei bua hi. Leei sia, sia a, uk thei hi ngawlin, thi theina nguu taw kidim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Leei sia ih Topa le Pa tungah lungdamkona in ih zangh a, Pathian taw a kisunin a kivawt ih mipuite haamsiatna in ih zangh si hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lungdamkona le haamsiatna kammalte sia kamhawng khat sung panin pusuak khawm hi. Ka suapuite awng, tubang hi tu kilawm ngawl hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuilim le tuikhaa sia ciktui naak khat sung pan pusuak khawm ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka suapuite awng, theikung khat in olive ngate nga thei ngawl hi; sapitkung khat in thei ngate nga thei ngawl hi; sii tuinaak in tuilim piangsak thei ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Note sungah a ciim thutel thei na om uh ziam? Amate in tuasia a nuntakna pha taw ahizong, kiniamkhiakna le ciimna taw a pha sepnate taw ahizong lak tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ahihang na thinsung ah eenna, thin natna le duhopnate a om le, na ciimna na kiphatsakpuina taw thumaan thutak sia langpanin mawna vawt heak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuabang ciimna sia vantung panin hong paisuk hi ngawl hi; tua in leitung neisa hi a, thaa vai hi ngawlin, doai vai ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ki eenna le duhopna omna munah buaina le siatna namcin zongh om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ahihang tungsang pan ciimna sia a masabel in thiangtho hi; tua in kilemna, cikna, lemzawngna zongh ahi hi. Tua in kihesuakna taw kidim a, a pha sepnate piangsak hi; tua in, kidoidanna nei ngawlin, kihithepsakna nei ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Phatna in kilemna piangsakte ii a tu thaicii panin a piang thaw an ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Note sungah kihauna le kidona teng sia koisung pan hong pai ziam? Na sungah a kido tawntung leitung nopna na deina uhte pan hong pai ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nate dei a, na nga thei ngawl uh ciangin, ngual thatlum tu in na kingingta uh hi; nate nasia takin na dei uh a, ahizong na nga zo bua uh hi, tuasia ciangin na kihau uh a, na kido uh hi. Na dei uhte na nga ngawl uh sia, banghang ziam cile Pathian munah na ngen bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuaciangin na nget uh ciang, na nga bua uh hi, banghang ziam cile na niimnate pha ngawl hi; noma nopsak natu sung bek ah na zak tu uh nate na ngen uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Thumaan ngawl mihingte awng! Leitung ii ngualtamh ih hi le Pathian ii ngal ih hi hunlam he ngawl nu ziam? A kuama po leitung ngualtamh a suak nuam sia Pathian ii ngal suak nuam ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Laithiangtho sungah, “Pathian ii ih sungah hong koisak thaa sia a nasia mama lungngulnate taw kidim hi,” a ci sia thumaan ngawlin ngaisun heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ahihang Pathian hong piak thuthiamna sia khohzaw kan lai hi. Laithiangtho in “Pathian in a kiphasakte nalh a, ahihang a kiniamkhiakte thuthiamna pia hi,” a ci bangma hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua ahikom Pathian tungah ki aap vun. Doaimangpa nalh vun, tua hile note kung pan tai tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Pathian kungah hong neak tavun, tua hile Pathian in note hong neak tu hi. Na khut uh sil vun, no mawneite awng! Na thinsung uh thiansua vun, no a kihitheamsakte awng!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Heena, kaana, tauna taw om vun; na nuina uh sia kaana taw laih tavun a, na lungdamna uh sia, maikhinna taw laih tavun!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Topa mai ah noma le noma kiniamkhiak tavun, tua hile ama in hong laamto tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka suapuite awng, khat le khat na kisonsia heak vun. Tapidaw suapui khat a sonsia ahibuale a tung a thu a khen sia in, Thukham sonsia a thukhen ahi hi. Thukham tungah thu na khen le, Thukham a zui nawn ngawl, Thukham tungah thukhenpa na hi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Pathian bekma thukham pia Pa le thukhenpa ahi hi. Ama bek in, ngum thei a, susia thei hi. Na mipuite tungah thukhen tu in nang sia akua kisa ni ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Tuni ahibuale zing ciangin, khua khat ah khual va haw tong i, tualai ah kum khat bang taamin, sum meet vawt in, sum tam mama thalaw tong,” a cite awng hong ngai tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Na nuntakna sia zing ciangin bangbang hi tu ci ngawngawn na he bua uh hi! Note in tawmvei hong kilangh zok a, a bo kik meikhu lomno khat taw na kibang uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Na pau tu uh sia hi bang hizaw tu hi: “Topa deina a om le ih nungta tu a, hisia ahibuale ziasia ih vawt tu hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ahihang no, tu in kiphasak a, kisuangtaak nu hi; tuabang kisuantaakna theampo sia maan ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua ahikom a pha tu he napi a pha a vawt ngawl sia in mihing mawnei ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tu in, no sumhaute awng, hong ngai tavun! No tungah hong tung tu ngimna haksatnate huvau kapin mau vun!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na hauna uh teng sia muat zo a, na puansilh teng sia nget in ne zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na khamhte le na ngunnte sia eakseau zo hi. Tuaciang hi a eakseaute in, no langkhat panin tetti hong hi tu a, meikuang taw kibangin, na sa uh hong ne khawng tu hi. Hi ni tawpkhak hun sungah, note in haunate na khol zo uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na lo sungah naseam mihingte ii thaman na pia bua uh hi. Amate ii phunnate ngai vun! Na an uh hong laksakte ii auna sia Topa Vaanglianbel Pathian bil sungah theng zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hi leitung ah na nuntakna uh sia a liap a vaal nate le nopsakna taw kidim hi. Hong kingaw lup ni ciang na thau natu in noma le noma na kivaak zo uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mawna nei ngawl mihingte mawsak in, na thatlum zo uh hi, tuaciang amate in no hong nalh ngawl uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua ahikom, ka suapuite awng, Topa hong pai mateng in, na thin uh sausak vun. Lothopa khat in, leitang tung pan an manpha hong pian natu sia, bangza in thinsauna taw ngak ziam en vun. Amate in khuapi ngua le tuk ngua sia thinsau takin ngak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />No zongh na thin uh a sau kul hi. Na lametna uh saangsak vun, banghang ziam cile Topa ii hong pai tu ni hong nai zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka suapuite awng, note khat le khat tungah lungkim ngawlna taw na kiphunsan heak vun, tua hile Pathian in no tungah thu hong khen ngawl tu hi. Thukhenpa sia hong nai zo a, hong kilangh tu in kithoai zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka suapuite awng, Topa min suangin a pau kamsaangte phawk vun. Thuakna sungah thinsau takin a thuak zo amate ii thuak zawk hatna sia ettee in nei tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amate sia mihing lungdamte hi ih ci hi, banghang ziam cile amate in thuak zo uh hi. Job ii thin sauna te na za zo uh a, a tawpna ah Topa ii piakkikna thu na he zo uh hi. Banghang ziam cile, Topa sia hesuakna le ciliapna taw kidim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A thupibelin ci leang suapuite awng, kamciam na vawt uh ciangin tomlo in kiciam heak vun. Vantung taw ahizong leitung taw ahizong, nadang khat pawpo taw ahizong tomlo in kiciam heak vun. Hi na sak uh ciang, “Hi hi” bekma ci vun, ahi ngawlna ah, “Hi bo” ci lel vun, tua hile Pathian ii thukhenna na thuak buatu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A ngim nga khat po no sungah na om uh ziam? Thungen tahen. A lungdam khat po na om uh ziam? Ama in pokna late sa tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A cina khat po na om uh ziam? Pawlpi upate sam hen a, amate in thungetsakin, olive thau taw Topa min suangin zut tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hi upna taw thungetna in ciina damsak tu hi. Topa in ciidamna pia kik tu a, tuaciang mawna a vawtte kimaisak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua ahikom, na mawna uh sia khat le khat tungah kipualaak vun a, khat le khat thu na kingetsak vun, tua hile hong damsak tu hi. Mipha thumaan thutang khat ii thungetna in vaang nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Elijah zong eima bangma mihing khat ahi hi. Ama in ngua a zuk ngawl natu in, nasia takin thungen a, kum thum le kum lang nguatui hang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nguazuk kik natu thungen kik leleau a, van in nguatui hong buaksuk a, lei in an piangsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ka suapuite awng, note sung panin, khat po in, thumaan thutak panin, lampial a, a dang khat in hong ciapui kik le,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />hi thu phawk tavun: a kuama po mihing a maw khat sia ama ngamtat khialna pan hong khealsak ahile, tua pa in mawneipa ii thaa a thi natu panin hun tu a, mawna tam mamate kimaisakna piangsak tu hi.
  </para>
</usx>
